{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1899036458922561643,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Socket Layer Overview",
      "source_hash": 17654568273193785593,
      "context_hash": 8820399373976158580,
      "translation": "소켓 계층 개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "How the kernel maps userspace socket calls to protocol implementations",
      "source_hash": 2583370757491799461,
      "context_hash": 14411364345863539096,
      "translation": "커널이 사용자 공간의 소켓 호출을 프로토콜 구현에 매핑하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The socket abstraction",
      "source_hash": 7590102820280968160,
      "context_hash": 12977162823209546607,
      "translation": "소켓 추상화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A socket is a bidirectional communication endpoint.",
      "source_hash": 18221227395437359110,
      "context_hash": 12120954322193616092,
      "translation": "소켓은 양방향 통신 엔드포인트입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629707Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "From userspace, it's just a file descriptor.",
      "source_hash": 7130915205801430906,
      "context_hash": 11536433317111593395,
      "translation": "사용자 공간에서 보면 소켓은 단지 파일 디스크립터일 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Internally, it's a stack of three structures:",
      "source_hash": 11989284619581019740,
      "context_hash": 4608554768169819683,
      "translation": "내부적으로는 세 가지 구조체가 쌓인 형태입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct socket — the VFS-facing layer",
      "source_hash": 13549644041506958542,
      "context_hash": 16874830760570228384,
      "translation": "struct socket — VFS를 향한 계층",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`proto_ops` is the dispatch table mapping socket syscalls to protocol code:",
      "source_hash": 6283055750532860199,
      "context_hash": 8566694504986432315,
      "translation": "`proto_ops`는 소켓 시스템 콜을 프로토콜 코드에 매핑하는 디스패치 테이블입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "mapping": "매핑",
        "syscalls": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "For TCP/IPv4, `proto_ops = inet_stream_ops`.",
      "source_hash": 1413253212980128844,
      "context_hash": 16858022305180690481,
      "translation": "TCP/IPv4에서는 `proto_ops = inet_stream_ops`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "For UDP, `proto_ops = inet_dgram_ops`.",
      "source_hash": 14336876457863308930,
      "context_hash": 16897894208971499465,
      "translation": "UDP에서는 `proto_ops = inet_dgram_ops`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "For AF_UNIX, `proto_ops = unix_stream_ops`.",
      "source_hash": 13689307190568050787,
      "context_hash": 4443708422453659047,
      "translation": "AF_UNIX에서는 `proto_ops = unix_stream_ops`입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct sock — the protocol-facing layer",
      "source_hash": 4116012866537556639,
      "context_hash": 201542753289554169,
      "translation": "struct sock — 프로토콜을 향한 계층",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "struct proto — the protocol implementation",
      "source_hash": 3708831251768721472,
      "context_hash": 3439952601457096703,
      "translation": "struct proto — 프로토콜 구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Each protocol registers a `struct proto` that contains the actual work:",
      "source_hash": 10806605358286470307,
      "context_hash": 3194546083959169390,
      "translation": "각 프로토콜은 실제 작업을 담은 `struct proto`를 등록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "TCP: `struct proto tcp_prot` at `net/ipv4/tcp_ipv4.c` UDP: `struct proto udp_prot` at `net/ipv4/udp.c`",
      "source_hash": 14081192693424002409,
      "context_hash": 4196355029148787091,
      "translation": "TCP: `net/ipv4/tcp_ipv4.c`의 `struct proto tcp_prot` UDP: `net/ipv4/udp.c`의 `struct proto udp_prot`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629708Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Creating a socket: socket(2)",
      "source_hash": 14223980169092961613,
      "context_hash": 13808565900536753795,
      "translation": "소켓 생성: socket(2)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The two dispatch levels",
      "source_hash": 10326191912768363008,
      "context_hash": 9641671643566258204,
      "translation": "두 단계의 디스패치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The double-layer dispatch (proto_ops → proto) exists because:",
      "source_hash": 4230598386566749708,
      "context_hash": 10870140746856504048,
      "translation": "이중 계층 디스패치(proto_ops → proto)가 존재하는 이유는 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`proto_ops` handles the **VFS interface** (file descriptor semantics, socket states, address family dispatch)",
      "source_hash": 10263170894541640871,
      "context_hash": 1654471500607119268,
      "translation": "`proto_ops`는 **VFS 인터페이스**(파일 디스크립터 의미 체계, 소켓 상태, 주소 패밀리 디스패치)를 처리합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "VFS": "VFS",
        "address": "주소",
        "file descriptor": "파일 디스크립터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "`proto` handles the **protocol implementation** (TCP state machine, UDP demux, etc.)",
      "source_hash": 11471541786800668462,
      "context_hash": 7051643263781348772,
      "translation": "`proto`는 **프로토콜 구현**(TCP 상태 머신, UDP demux 등)을 처리합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "UDP": "UDP",
        "state machine": "상태 머신"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "A single layer can't serve both: `sendmsg()` on a TCP socket needs different behavior from `sendmsg()` on a UDP socket, but both go through the same VFS file operations.",
      "source_hash": 12827786316301728720,
      "context_hash": 7223584620137938403,
      "translation": "하나의 계층으로는 두 가지를 모두 감당할 수 없습니다. TCP 소켓에 대한 `sendmsg()`는 UDP 소켓에 대한 `sendmsg()`와 다르게 동작해야 하지만, 둘 다 같은 VFS 파일 연산을 거치기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "UDP": "UDP",
        "VFS": "VFS"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Receive path: how data reaches the socket",
      "source_hash": 4789506597290961934,
      "context_hash": 3549043785660069124,
      "translation": "수신 경로: 데이터가 소켓에 도달하는 방식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The `sk_backlog` handles the case where a packet arrives while the socket lock is held (e.g., during another syscall).",
      "source_hash": 14424979077124142360,
      "context_hash": 4535942824115873148,
      "translation": "`sk_backlog`는 소켓 락이 잡혀 있는 동안(예: 다른 시스템 콜 수행 중) 패킷이 도착하는 경우를 처리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Packets are held in the backlog and processed when the lock is released.",
      "source_hash": 13345181567074408933,
      "context_hash": 3904333971479811456,
      "translation": "패킷은 backlog에 보관되었다가 락이 해제될 때 처리됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Socket buffers and memory",
      "source_hash": 5929381745834401690,
      "context_hash": 11038846850032559948,
      "translation": "소켓 버퍼와 메모리",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629709Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`sk->sk_rmem_alloc` tracks memory currently held in `sk_receive_queue`.",
      "source_hash": 7920843780213996899,
      "context_hash": 10562252947503596205,
      "translation": "`sk->sk_rmem_alloc`는 현재 `sk_receive_queue`에 보관된 메모리 양을 추적합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "memory": "메모리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "When it exceeds `sk_rcvbuf`, new incoming packets are silently dropped by the kernel — for TCP the sender retransmits, but for UDP the data is simply lost.",
      "source_hash": 17753540321653178648,
      "context_hash": 6813732176729222501,
      "translation": "이 값이 `sk_rcvbuf`를 초과하면 새로 들어오는 패킷은 커널이 아무 알림 없이 버립니다. TCP에서는 송신 측이 재전송하지만, UDP에서는 데이터가 그대로 유실됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "UDP": "UDP",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Socket state machine (TCP)",
      "source_hash": 4575174492558145537,
      "context_hash": 7061059294004871941,
      "translation": "소켓 상태 머신(TCP)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP",
        "state machine": "상태 머신"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`sk->sk_state` (accessed via `sk->__sk_common.skc_state`) tracks this.",
      "source_hash": 1444046473968697850,
      "context_hash": 14564508473947939940,
      "translation": "`sk->sk_state`(`sk->__sk_common.skc_state`를 통해 접근)가 이를 추적합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The TCP protocol implementation transitions these states and calls `sk->sk_state_change()` to notify waiting pollers.",
      "source_hash": 15107774302036081298,
      "context_hash": 7812327193408310416,
      "translation": "TCP 프로토콜 구현은 이 상태들을 전이시키고, 대기 중인 poller에게 알리기 위해 `sk->sk_state_change()`를 호출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TCP": "TCP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Inspecting sockets",
      "source_hash": 13700764443661035349,
      "context_hash": 5120632982647497428,
      "translation": "소켓 검사",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:32:01.629710Z",
      "issues": []
    },
